                  Parameters for SPECSIM3D
                  ************************

START OF PARAMETERS:
0.0 0.0 0.0                   xmin ymin zmin  (coordinates of the first node)
1.0 1.0 1.0                   dx dy dz  (grid spacing)
100 100 1                     nx ny nz  (nodes per axis, nz = 1 gives a 2D field)
0.2 1                         nugget nstruct  (nugget variance, number of nested structures)
2 0.8 30 15 15 30.0 0.0 0.0   itype sill ahmax ahmin avert azimuth dip plunge  (itype: 1 spherical, 2 exponential, 3 gaussian)
4003 20 1                     iseed nreal ipad  (random seed, number of realizations, ipad: 1 = padded periodic grid)
example_cond3_2d_nugget
2                             nout  (number of outputs; one code per line follows)
4                             output code: 4 = one VTK XML file <base>.vti with all the realizations (ParaView opens it directly)
3                             output code: 3 = raw float32 file <base>.bin (realizations consecutive, x fastest)
1                             icond  (0 = unconditional simulation, 1 = conditional: the conditioning block follows)
data_2d.dat                   datafile
1 2 0 3 0                     columns: x y z value weight (z column 0 because the grid has nz = 1)
-1.0e21 1.0e21                trimming limits
0 0.0                         itrans = 0: values used as they are (mean skmean = 0)
-5.0 5.0                      zmin zmax (not used)
1 0.0
1 0.0
45.0 45.0 45.0                search radii (the vertical radius is irrelevant for nz = 1)
30.0 0.0 0.0                  search angles
16                            ndmax
